# The controller reports the sun and daylight at the clock's time of day (docs/design/day-night-cycle.md Phase B).

case sun height and daylight follow the set time
start walk raft
click
lock
press Backquote
type time freeze
press Enter
frame 50
lock
press Backquote
type time set 0.5
press Enter
frame 50 x2
expect daylight ~ 1
expect sun.y > 0.9
lock
press Backquote
type time set 0
press Enter
frame 50 x2
expect daylight ~ 0.15
expect sun.y < -0.9
lock
press Backquote
type time set 0.25
press Enter
frame 50 x2
expect sun.y ~ 0
expect daylight < 1
expect daylight > 0.15

case a frozen clock gives a constant value
start walk raft
click
lock
press Backquote
type time freeze
press Enter
frame 50 x2
expect time.frozen = true
mark
frame 50 x2
expect sun.y ~ 0.28006
frame 500 x10
expect sun.y ~ 0.28006
expect daylight ~ 1
